      "id": "CVE-2026-85973",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-12T16:49:57.365Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-12T16:49:57.365Z",
      "description": "Progress MarkLogic Server 12.x releases before 12.1.0 may use cleartext transport for certain cluster-management communications. A network-positioned attacker could intercept or modify information transmitted through an affected connection.",
      "severity": 7.4,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Progress Software Corporation MarkLogic Server\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-319 (CWE-319)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://community.progress.com/s/article/Marklogic-Critical-Security-Alert-Bulletin-October-2026",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
